n inside the frame and within8. Conditional price estimate uses only completed historical targets; >=12 distinct target days, otherwise current-median fallback. One pseudo-count per class; no calibrated-confidence claim.","selection":"Trial selection uses validation price MAE only if >=10 common ready target days, else WAIT/no chosen trial. Keep Jul17 validation and Aug21 final-test boundaries from preceding work. Test metrics are descriptive when selector WAIT.","limits":"Previously inspected archive; this new target has not been forward validated. Variable event timing cannot honestly be drawn as a fixed eight-point price path. No website promotion. Paired circular five-day bootstrap,5000 draws,97.5% intervals; >=30 target days required."},"schema":"wlr-aba-v2","publishedAt":1792578995296,"liveLimit":"Historical scores concern first eligible segment snapshots, including PRE candle 0 using preceding closed history when ready. An already-open segment may be selected for a new causal live forecast; that later entry has not been separately forward validated."}